     Row 2: Add to Cart | Buy Now      (sold out: Sold out | Notify Me, Buy Now below)
     Row 3: payment icons
   The quantity row is display:contents, so its children and Buy Now share
   one grid on .product-form__buttons: [1fr][icon][icon][1fr]. Wishlist and
   Share are square icon columns; Add to Cart (cols 1-2) and Buy Now
